(3948136, 562766, 15711, '<td valign="top">Superb light and shadow. Love the up in the air - man you snapped it at the perfect time.  This is a smile maker.</td>', 'Superb light and shadow. Love the up in the air - man you snapped it at the perfect time.  This is a smile maker.', '2007-07-30 01:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
