(3948155, 561996, 66515, '<td valign="top">Slight tilt to the left. Straightening would help quite a bit. Dodging the main subject''s face a bit would also help as its nearly a silhouette. <br/> <br/>I like the concept here though. You capture a lot of motion that definitely creates a busy atmosphere. Pretty well done under such lighting too.</td>', 'Slight tilt to the left. Straightening would help quite a bit. Dodging the main subject''s face a bit would also help as its nearly a silhouette.  I like the concept here though. You capture a lot of motion that definitely creates a busy atmosphere. Pretty well done under such lighting too.', '2007-07-30 01:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948157, 561020, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  Love your DOF.</td>', 'Nice image!  Love your DOF.', '2007-07-30 01:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948158, 563143, 15711, '<td valign="top">Thos guys just amaze me.  Wonderful. I like the overall darkness except for his face, hers and the hints of pink and red throughout. NICE</td>', 'Thos guys just amaze me.  Wonderful. I like the overall darkness except for his face, hers and the hints of pink and red throughout. NICE', '2007-07-30 01:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948160, 562616, 32872, '<td valign="top">Sweet image!</td>', 'Sweet image!', '2007-07-30 01:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948162, 562263, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here however I would have considered not desaturating the musician as well. The selective coloring helps separate the subject from the background but with him being desaturated as well it makes it seem like the subject is the shirt and the sax. Otherwise, well done and quite pleasing to look at.</td>', 'I like the idea here however I would have considered not desaturating the musician as well. The selective coloring helps separate the subject from the background but with him being desaturated as well it makes it seem like the subject is the shirt and the sax. Otherwise, well done and quite pleasing to look at.', '2007-07-30 01:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948164, 562196, 32872, '<td valign="top">Oh, I get it...he''s up to no good???  Great detail and tones.</td>', 'Oh, I get it...he''s up to no good???  Great detail and tones.', '2007-07-30 01:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948165, 562252, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOD I love blur. My taste tells me I''d crop out the TTE News Connection part. It might make for a differently shaped image, but that doesn''t matter to me. Love the vivid tones and the movement.</td>', 'GOD I love blur. My taste tells me I''d crop out the TTE News Connection part. It might make for a differently shaped image, but that doesn''t matter to me. Love the vivid tones and the movement.', '2007-07-30 01:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948168, 563205, 15711, '<td valign="top">Dang!</td>', 'Dang!', '2007-07-30 01:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948170, 562793, 32872, '<td valign="top">Interesting image!  He''s carrying eggs.  Wonderful detail.  Good capture!</td>', 'Interesting image!  He''s carrying eggs.  Wonderful detail.  Good capture!', '2007-07-30 01:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948171, 563003, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has perfect balance. The three rectangles of the windows, the tree and the man with the boy.  I like the highs, lows and medium tones all in perfect harmony with one another.</td>', 'This has perfect balance. The three rectangles of the windows, the tree and the man with the boy.  I like the highs, lows and medium tones all in perfect harmony with one another.', '2007-07-30 01:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948175, 561284, 32872, '<td valign="top">Love this one!!  Great capture...well done.  The dog is the perfect touch.  Great lighting and tones, wonderful detail too.</td>', 'Love this one!!  Great capture...well done.  The dog is the perfect touch.  Great lighting and tones, wonderful detail too.', '2007-07-30 01:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948176, 562053, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the connection between the title and the image. Good titles, such as this one, support the image and don''t act as crutch. (i.e. they act as an explanation). <br/> <br/>The angle is a little plain and I suspect you took this shot from across the street. One of the challenges for this type of subject is getting up the nerve to talk to the person you are photographing. It does take away some of the spontaneity but it does help you "see" the subject better and better empathize with them.</td>', 'I like the connection between the title and the image. Good titles, such as this one, support the image and don''t act as crutch. (i.e. they act as an explanation).  The angle is a little plain and I suspect you took this shot from across the street. One of the challenges for this type of subject is getting up the nerve to talk to the person you are photographing. It does take away some of the spontaneity but it does help you "see" the subject better and better empathize with them.', '2007-07-30 01:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948178, 562751, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of chaos here.  The guy is about to walk out of the shot, the boy is running by and the buy with his CHILL sign on wheels, while the guy in blue is on his morning walk.  Nice story.  Has a hectic sense.  Each character has his own agenda.</td>', 'I like the sense of chaos here.  The guy is about to walk out of the shot, the boy is running by and the buy with his CHILL sign on wheels, while the guy in blue is on his morning walk.  Nice story.  Has a hectic sense.  Each character has his own agenda.', '2007-07-30 01:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948181, 562463, 15711, '<td valign="top">You couldn''t have put them in more colorful costumes!!</td>', 'You couldn''t have put them in more colorful costumes!!', '2007-07-30 01:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948182, 562450, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is delicious.  I love the soft blur of the lights'' glows. Very nice. I like the perspective too.</td>', 'Oh this is delicious.  I love the soft blur of the lights'' glows. Very nice. I like the perspective too.', '2007-07-30 01:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948185, 561578, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I fear for the DNMC votes you may receive because there is no street. (I however am not so narrow minded). Nice colors and the background, though blurred, has sufficient detail to provide context for the subjects. <br/> <br/>The fact they are looking across the frame helps as well. It draws the eye across the picture nicely. Because of this, perhaps landscape orientation might have worked well rather than portait.<br/> <br/>Overall this is quite well done.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I fear for the DNMC votes you may receive because there is no street. (I however am not so narrow minded). Nice colors and the background, though blurred, has sufficient detail to provide context for the subjects.  The fact they are looking across the frame helps as well. It draws the eye across the picture nicely. Because of this, perhaps landscape orientation might have worked well rather than portait. Overall this is quite well done.', '2007-07-30 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948186, 561149, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - what exquisite lighting.  AWESOME</td>', 'WOW - what exquisite lighting.  AWESOME', '2007-07-30 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
