(3948198, 561754, 66515, '<td valign="top">The posed of the two men definitely lend to the title you chose. Good choice on the black and white conversion.  Moving to the right would have been helpful so you could create more visual separation between the two men.  A lower angle might have also been more visually appealing.</td>', 'The posed of the two men definitely lend to the title you chose. Good choice on the black and white conversion.  Moving to the right would have been helpful so you could create more visual separation between the two men.  A lower angle might have also been more visually appealing.', '2007-07-30 01:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
