(3948203, 561265, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great composition, too bad the graffiti was painted over, and too bad she isnt wearing a short skirt! Great capture.</td>', 'Great composition, too bad the graffiti was painted over, and too bad she isnt wearing a short skirt! Great capture.', '2007-07-30 01:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948204, 561284, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is terrific.  I like the tilted feel - appropriate for the dishonest way most of the carnival booths are run.  That dog - man what a perfect title.</td>', 'That is terrific.  I like the tilted feel - appropriate for the dishonest way most of the carnival booths are run.  That dog - man what a perfect title.', '2007-07-30 01:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948205, 563293, 15711, '<td valign="top">Man you nailed the title.  Love the composition and their place in the shot. NICE!</td>', 'Man you nailed the title.  Love the composition and their place in the shot. NICE!', '2007-07-30 01:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948206, 563011, 66515, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love the use shallow DOF here. The colors are terrific and really make your eye explore the shot. I like the sharpness you obtained in the main area of focus as it brings out a lot of subtle detail. The candid expressions of the people really works well.</td>', 'Wow! Love the use shallow DOF here. The colors are terrific and really make your eye explore the shot. I like the sharpness you obtained in the main area of focus as it brings out a lot of subtle detail. The candid expressions of the people really works well.', '2007-07-30 01:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948208, 562606, 31637, '<td valign="top">Not exactly streets here.</td>', 'Not exactly streets here.', '2007-07-30 01:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948209, 561839, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition.  What makes it is the ray of reflective light beaming to our left. I like this very much.</td>', 'Perfect composition.  What makes it is the ray of reflective light beaming to our left. I like this very much.', '2007-07-30 01:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948211, 562651, 15711, '<td valign="top">I tried that and it was horrid.  You mastered it perfectly.</td>', 'I tried that and it was horrid.  You mastered it perfectly.', '2007-07-30 01:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948213, 563231, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I like the choice of title (though I might have called it getting in my way!).  Interesting choice using black and white. It really enhances your subject. The background gives good context to the subject without drawing a lot of attention.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I like the choice of title (though I might have called it getting in my way!).  Interesting choice using black and white. It really enhances your subject. The background gives good context to the subject without drawing a lot of attention.', '2007-07-30 01:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948214, 563145, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent editing.  I love that he has one foot up - maybe a symbolic gesture on your part. Great shot. 8</td>', 'Excellent editing.  I love that he has one foot up - maybe a symbolic gesture on your part. Great shot. 8', '2007-07-30 01:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948217, 562773, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty fab.  Excellent DOF. I like that he''s facing the other direction from the pedestrians that are slightly OOF.</td>', 'That''s pretty fab.  Excellent DOF. I like that he''s facing the other direction from the pedestrians that are slightly OOF.', '2007-07-30 01:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948219, 562854, 31637, '<td valign="top">Too close of a crop, this could be in someone''s backyard for all we know.</td>', 'Too close of a crop, this could be in someone''s backyard for all we know.', '2007-07-30 01:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948221, 561149, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what to make of this. It seems to be below the streets rather than on them. That aside, black and white does work here as it adds emphasis to the shadows. I may have been tempted to dodge his face a bit to allow us to see a bit more detail.</td>', 'Not really sure what to make of this. It seems to be below the streets rather than on them. That aside, black and white does work here as it adds emphasis to the shadows. I may have been tempted to dodge his face a bit to allow us to see a bit more detail.', '2007-07-30 01:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948226, 562878, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT title.  Whether posed or not, the juxtaposition between her and the James Dean caricature is killer. Love it.</td>', 'GREAT title.  Whether posed or not, the juxtaposition between her and the James Dean caricature is killer. Love it.', '2007-07-30 01:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948228, 562257, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW- like it has ink stamped in layers.  HOw beautiful.</td>', 'WOW- like it has ink stamped in layers.  HOw beautiful.', '2007-07-30 01:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948230, 563286, 66515, '<td valign="top">Another interesting take on the challenge. I''m not sure about the black and white as there is probably some really nice colors to be seen here. As black and white it seems a little flat and could do with some contrast.</td>', 'Another interesting take on the challenge. I''m not sure about the black and white as there is probably some really nice colors to be seen here. As black and white it seems a little flat and could do with some contrast.', '2007-07-30 01:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948231, 562574, 31637, '<td valign="top">This is a good entry. The only problem is that there is not proof of the setting being on the street. This isn''t a park either. He could be anywhere here. Place of work for sure, but is he outdoors? Good luck, It''s a good photo though.</td>', 'This is a good entry. The only problem is that there is not proof of the setting being on the street. This isn''t a park either. He could be anywhere here. Place of work for sure, but is he outdoors? Good luck, It''s a good photo though.', '2007-07-30 01:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948234, 562427, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the touch of softness and how they are illuminated from darkness.  VERY nice. GOOD LUCK.</td>', 'I like the touch of softness and how they are illuminated from darkness.  VERY nice. GOOD LUCK.', '2007-07-30 01:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948237, 562979, 80814, '<td valign="top">Great expression!</td>', 'Great expression!', '2007-07-30 01:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948238, 563010, 66515, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you processed this but the scene seems quite muted. It looks like you were going for selective desaturation but didn''t apply it to the whole background. In any event I don''t feel it works for this shot as the man''s shirt matches the background too much. Leaving it in color would have allowed him to stand out against the background more I think.</td>', 'I''m not sure how you processed this but the scene seems quite muted. It looks like you were going for selective desaturation but didn''t apply it to the whole background. In any event I don''t feel it works for this shot as the man''s shirt matches the background too much. Leaving it in color would have allowed him to stand out against the background more I think.', '2007-07-30 01:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948241, 562910, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. Strange focus here. I''m torn between calling it artful or out of focus. We''ll call it artful for now. I like the tones throughout and this works quite well as black and white (especially with the "artful" focus). I like the patterns and repetition in this shot (i.e. the posts, and the bricks). The white jacket on the subject really helps identify them as the subject.</td>', 'Interesting angle. Strange focus here. I''m torn between calling it artful or out of focus. We''ll call it artful for now. I like the tones throughout and this works quite well as black and white (especially with the "artful" focus). I like the patterns and repetition in this shot (i.e. the posts, and the bricks). The white jacket on the subject really helps identify them as the subject.', '2007-07-30 01:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948250, 562763, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really love the colours and the composition but I think it would have the pizazz and suit the challenge more if it had a human or their reflection in the shot.</td>', 'I really love the colours and the composition but I think it would have the pizazz and suit the challenge more if it had a human or their reflection in the shot.', '2007-07-30 02:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948253, 561163, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the shadow and all of the signs  Nice use of slight desat as well. 8</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the shadow and all of the signs  Nice use of slight desat as well. 8', '2007-07-30 02:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948256, 562288, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the fisheye. Nicely composed.</td>', 'I like the curve of the fisheye. Nicely composed.', '2007-07-30 02:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948258, 562407, 66515, '<td valign="top">The subject is given to us by the title rather than the composition. For me there seems to be a visual struggle between the elderly woman on the left and the seller and the woman on the right. Portrait orientation would worked well to help us with this. <br/> <br/>Cute picture otherwise. I like how it portrays the elderly in a different way. e.g. With a bicycle helmet and running shoes</td>', 'The subject is given to us by the title rather than the composition. For me there seems to be a visual struggle between the elderly woman on the left and the seller and the woman on the right. Portrait orientation would worked well to help us with this.  Cute picture otherwise. I like how it portrays the elderly in a different way. e.g. With a bicycle helmet and running shoes', '2007-07-30 02:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948259, 562556, 29269, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! This is what street photography is all about, as far as my understanding goes. Bumping to 9.</td>', 'Wonderful shot! This is what street photography is all about, as far as my understanding goes. Bumping to 9.', '2007-07-30 02:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948261, 562897, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  How funny.  This makes me thik of an old still from a movie.  no pure whites but sort of minimal dull tones. Kinda cool.</td>', 'ROFL  How funny.  This makes me thik of an old still from a movie.  no pure whites but sort of minimal dull tones. Kinda cool.', '2007-07-30 02:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
