(3948297, 559542, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and interesting use of shadows. The dodging on the person''s right shoulder does seem a little out of place however I might be picky on that point. I like the texture that you captured in the stones as it really helps create a visual rhythm. Well done.</td>', 'Nice composition and interesting use of shadows. The dodging on the person''s right shoulder does seem a little out of place however I might be picky on that point. I like the texture that you captured in the stones as it really helps create a visual rhythm. Well done.', '2007-07-30 02:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948299, 562902, 33379, '<td valign="top">now this is a great image.  very candid, i love it!</td>', 'now this is a great image.  very candid, i love it!', '2007-07-30 02:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948304, 559551, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. This shot has a good photojournalistic quality that, thus far, has been rare in this challenge. You tell the story well here and still have managed to create an artful composition. Well done!</td>', 'Nice capture. This shot has a good photojournalistic quality that, thus far, has been rare in this challenge. You tell the story well here and still have managed to create an artful composition. Well done!', '2007-07-30 02:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
