(3948333, 561896, 6349, '<td valign="top">I find this photo hard to come to terms with as there is no real focus.  When searching the photo, however, I find many things of interest so perhaps it is an interesting scene made less interesting by an over-abundance of interestingness.  I think that''s pretty interesting so I''m going to give it a 6.</td>', 'I find this photo hard to come to terms with as there is no real focus.  When searching the photo, however, I find many things of interest so perhaps it is an interesting scene made less interesting by an over-abundance of interestingness.  I think that''s pretty interesting so I''m going to give it a 6.', '2007-07-30 02:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948337, 562624, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice colors in the scene and the editing (or lack of) gives it a very natural feel.  interestingly, the thing I find the most engaging in the photo is the person in the top left and the way they are framed by the hanging goods.  I might have considered doing a vertical portrait crop of this keeping just the left side, completely removing the lady on the right who is now the main subject.</td>', 'nice colors in the scene and the editing (or lack of) gives it a very natural feel.  interestingly, the thing I find the most engaging in the photo is the person in the top left and the way they are framed by the hanging goods.  I might have considered doing a vertical portrait crop of this keeping just the left side, completely removing the lady on the right who is now the main subject.', '2007-07-30 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948339, 562994, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure.  It looks a bit more like the short way to me.  :)  nice lines.</td>', 'I''m not so sure.  It looks a bit more like the short way to me.  :)  nice lines.', '2007-07-30 02:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948341, 562527, 33379, '<td valign="top">the girl adds to the emotion but i think if you wouldve made this black and white it would be better.  the green is very bold and takes away from the image.</td>', 'the girl adds to the emotion but i think if you wouldve made this black and white it would be better.  the green is very bold and takes away from the image.', '2007-07-30 02:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948342, 562167, 6349, '<td valign="top">Oh man, what a face.  He almost looks fake.  Great b+w.</td>', 'Oh man, what a face.  He almost looks fake.  Great b+w.', '2007-07-30 02:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
