(3948348, 561850, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot.  I would have titled it something cheesy like "Seperated by Time" (because of the watch).  The crop in the middle of the bird is a bit annoying but I suppose it can''t be helped unless you wanted to clone it out.  I''m not personally big on cloning things out myself so I can understand why you didn''t.</td>', 'Nice candid shot.  I would have titled it something cheesy like "Seperated by Time" (because of the watch).  The crop in the middle of the bird is a bit annoying but I suppose it can''t be helped unless you wanted to clone it out.  I''m not personally big on cloning things out myself so I can understand why you didn''t.', '2007-07-30 02:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
