(3948384, 562774, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I caught myself trying to imitate the dance.  It seems cheerful.  We need more cheerful in the streets even with all the cracks in the pavement.</td>', 'I like it.  I caught myself trying to imitate the dance.  It seems cheerful.  We need more cheerful in the streets even with all the cracks in the pavement.', '2007-07-30 02:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
