(3948497, 562202, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOAH - the juxtaposition between the man and the bird.  WOWZA. This is fabulous. The swirl of the brick pavers undulate and our eyes drift to the bird again.  FANTASTIC. 10 BRAVO</td>', 'WOAH - the juxtaposition between the man and the bird.  WOWZA. This is fabulous. The swirl of the brick pavers undulate and our eyes drift to the bird again.  FANTASTIC. 10 BRAVO', '2007-07-30 03:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948498, 562953, 6349, '<td valign="top">it''s her again.  and her and her.  and them.  in the car.  and the guy from nextdoor nobody talks to.  and yes, I want to.  play the game.</td>', 'it''s her again.  and her and her.  and them.  in the car.  and the guy from nextdoor nobody talks to.  and yes, I want to.  play the game.', '2007-07-30 03:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948501, 561221, 6349, '<td valign="top">this is so good i''m finding it hard to imagine it wasn''t posed but i''m going to vote as if it isn''t.</td>', 'this is so good i''m finding it hard to imagine it wasn''t posed but i''m going to vote as if it isn''t.', '2007-07-30 03:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948503, 562363, 6349, '<td valign="top">hahaha.  photographs in the street are not street photography?  I took photos at one of these things in Amsterdam.  Don''t know if this is the same one cause I think these exhibits are all over the place.  I shot mine at night and they are mostly blurry.  Yours is ok, but like mine, I would have liked to do more with the setting.</td>', 'hahaha.  photographs in the street are not street photography?  I took photos at one of these things in Amsterdam.  Don''t know if this is the same one cause I think these exhibits are all over the place.  I shot mine at night and they are mostly blurry.  Yours is ok, but like mine, I would have liked to do more with the setting.', '2007-07-30 03:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
