(3948753, 563155, 6349, '<td valign="top">brilliant.  10 and favorite.  I am absolutely certain I will find nothing better voting on the rest of this challenge.<br/> <br/>After voting I came back and I still agree, although there were many outstanding shots in the challenge that I also added to my favorites.  This is still by far my favorite of them all.  Just so many layers to this image on both a physical and a mental level.  Amazing.</td>', 'brilliant.  10 and favorite.  I am absolutely certain I will find nothing better voting on the rest of this challenge. After voting I came back and I still agree, although there were many outstanding shots in the challenge that I also added to my favorites.  This is still by far my favorite of them all.  Just so many layers to this image on both a physical and a mental level.  Amazing.', '2007-07-30 05:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948755, 561149, 60915, '<td valign="top">The light here is awesome!</td>', 'The light here is awesome!', '2007-07-30 05:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948757, 563199, 41357, '<td valign="top">seems as if U held the camera on a vibrator instead of a tripod</td>', 'seems as if U held the camera on a vibrator instead of a tripod', '2007-07-30 05:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948759, 562846, 41357, '<td valign="top">me too</td>', 'me too', '2007-07-30 05:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948764, 562751, 60915, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite in the challenge. I love the composition and the progression af ages throughout the shot. The guy standing in what appears to be a beer bottle on wheels is the icing on the cake and the three birds, the cherry on top! : ) Great stuff! 10</td>', 'This is my favourite in the challenge. I love the composition and the progression af ages throughout the shot. The guy standing in what appears to be a beer bottle on wheels is the icing on the cake and the three birds, the cherry on top! : ) Great stuff! 10', '2007-07-30 05:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
