(3949260, 562878, 30982, '<td valign="top">She''s positioned so perfectly I can''t help but think this is set up.  Nevertheless, it makes for a great image.  Well seen, well rendered.</td>', 'She''s positioned so perfectly I can''t help but think this is set up.  Nevertheless, it makes for a great image.  Well seen, well rendered.', '2007-07-30 10:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
