(3950884, 563145, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Like the film feel to this - Nice selective out of focus areas and tones - Very nice</td>', 'Nice capture - Like the film feel to this - Nice selective out of focus areas and tones - Very nice', '2007-07-30 18:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
