(3951644, 562527, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrast of her shirt against the bright green bench. Good, emotive capture.</td>', 'I like the color contrast of her shirt against the bright green bench. Good, emotive capture.', '2007-07-30 22:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951649, 562910, 80096, '<td valign="top">Lacks interest. Could be a sharper.</td>', 'Lacks interest. Could be a sharper.', '2007-07-30 22:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951651, 562066, 37965, '<td valign="top">bodaciously killer pic dude, my eyes are drawn to the front tire splash... 9</td>', 'bodaciously killer pic dude, my eyes are drawn to the front tire splash... 9', '2007-07-30 22:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951662, 562363, 80096, '<td valign="top">A little dark and out of focus. Good idea.</td>', 'A little dark and out of focus. Good idea.', '2007-07-30 22:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951668, 561524, 80096, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia effect. Good placement of elements.</td>', 'I like the sepia effect. Good placement of elements.', '2007-07-30 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951676, 561284, 51538, '<td valign="top">Rather nice light on yonder dog.  The tilt enhances, IMO.  8.</td>', 'Rather nice light on yonder dog.  The tilt enhances, IMO.  8.', '2007-07-30 23:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951681, 562652, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the implicit nature of your photo.  You leave plenty of room for the viewer to use his/her imagination.  Nice work. 8.</td>', 'I like the implicit nature of your photo.  You leave plenty of room for the viewer to use his/her imagination.  Nice work. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951682, 562150, 51538, '<td valign="top">BSA Bantam?  I used to ride one of those.  I like the scene and the desat. 8.</td>', 'BSA Bantam?  I used to ride one of those.  I like the scene and the desat. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951686, 561839, 51538, '<td valign="top">Colourful in a remarkably pleasant way.  The depth of field is really rather good, as is the exposure. 8.</td>', 'Colourful in a remarkably pleasant way.  The depth of field is really rather good, as is the exposure. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951688, 561856, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good juxtapoistion of elements. Good bw contrast. I like it.</td>', 'Good juxtapoistion of elements. Good bw contrast. I like it.', '2007-07-30 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951690, 562846, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting story suggested.  The bokeh background enhances the image.  Very nice work. 8.</td>', 'Interesting story suggested.  The bokeh background enhances the image.  Very nice work. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951691, 562845, 80096, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2007-07-30 23:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951692, 562510, 41675, '<td valign="top">Yeah - a happy image as opposed to the myriad of oppressive street scenes. I like the "glow" around the kids. Good contrast and composition too. Congratulations. I hope it does really well for you. 10</td>', 'Yeah - a happy image as opposed to the myriad of oppressive street scenes. I like the "glow" around the kids. Good contrast and composition too. Congratulations. I hope it does really well for you. 10', '2007-07-30 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951693, 561149, 51538, '<td valign="top">What''s going on here.  The slanted light is a nice teaser.  Seems to be street photography with a difference. 8.</td>', 'What''s going on here.  The slanted light is a nice teaser.  Seems to be street photography with a difference. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951694, 562905, 51538, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is mostly disappeared (and might be better in Shadows challenge) yet I like this image very much.  Implicit and tonal. 8.</td>', 'The subject matter is mostly disappeared (and might be better in Shadows challenge) yet I like this image very much.  Implicit and tonal. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951696, 562160, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely character in the lady''s face.  Her environment is hinted at (defocused bokeh) rather than explicit. 7.</td>', 'Lovely character in the lady''s face.  Her environment is hinted at (defocused bokeh) rather than explicit. 7.', '2007-07-30 23:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951698, 562651, 51538, '<td valign="top">Three is a nice number in design.  The grainy image is really rather good. 8.</td>', 'Three is a nice number in design.  The grainy image is really rather good. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951700, 559542, 51538, '<td valign="top">A dance on cobbles.  I''ve seen photos like this before.  But yours is nicely executed in every way. 8.</td>', 'A dance on cobbles.  I''ve seen photos like this before.  But yours is nicely executed in every way. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951707, 562857, 51538, '<td valign="top">British, surely.  Earthy.  It captures the zeitgeist.  8.</td>', 'British, surely.  Earthy.  It captures the zeitgeist.  8.', '2007-07-30 23:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951708, 560344, 41675, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s having lots of fun. For me, your image would be more focused on the little boy if you cropped out the busy background at the top.</td>', 'Looks like he''s having lots of fun. For me, your image would be more focused on the little boy if you cropped out the busy background at the top.', '2007-07-30 23:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951709, 562952, 51538, '<td valign="top">The out of frame look, which attracts the viewer into frame.  Nice colours and bokeh. 8.</td>', 'The out of frame look, which attracts the viewer into frame.  Nice colours and bokeh. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951711, 563092, 41675, '<td valign="top">He looks so very deep in thought - lost in his imagination. I like it.</td>', 'He looks so very deep in thought - lost in his imagination. I like it.', '2007-07-30 23:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951717, 561619, 51538, '<td valign="top">In the tonality it appears an ink-wash graphic rather than a photo.  Sterile in a way (I mean sort of clinically clean which is not really the human condition) - but really rather outstanding in another way. 8.</td>', 'In the tonality it appears an ink-wash graphic rather than a photo.  Sterile in a way (I mean sort of clinically clean which is not really the human condition) - but really rather outstanding in another way. 8.', '2007-07-30 23:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951718, 562763, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.</td>', 'Very interesting.', '2007-07-30 23:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951721, 561163, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of title. Well put and appropriate. I also like al the signs in the background. Nice photo.</td>', 'I like your choice of title. Well put and appropriate. I also like al the signs in the background. Nice photo.', '2007-07-30 23:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951735, 562904, 77196, '<td valign="top">OOF</td>', 'OOF', '2007-07-30 23:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951736, 562038, 80096, '<td valign="top">The only problem I see here is the photo appears to be contrived. Street photography is a form of documentary work and should be candid, not staged. If I''m wrong I apoligize. It''s a very good shot otherwise.</td>', 'The only problem I see here is the photo appears to be contrived. Street photography is a form of documentary work and should be candid, not staged. If I''m wrong I apoligize. It''s a very good shot otherwise.', '2007-07-30 23:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3951741, 562625, 77196, '<td valign="top">Overall greenish cast. Looks like it should be rotated to the left a bit.</td>', 'Overall greenish cast. Looks like it should be rotated to the left a bit.', '2007-07-30 23:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
