(3952278, 562710, 33672, '<td valign="top">Ireally like the lighting.</td>', 'Ireally like the lighting.', '2007-07-31 02:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3952294, 561943, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a great choice of subject, very interesting, and an engaging character. Composed well also. I think though, that the extreme shadows, and very harsh light on his face and beard (to the point of being blown out) are taking a lot away from the image. It looks like a tough exposure. A case where maybe a different angle would yield more favorable light? Or waiting for a cloud to cross the sun, if even for a moment, to catch a fleeting second of nice diffused light. Or, if this is someone that set''s up there on a regular basis, trying to catch on a different day, or a different time of day to catch some good light?</td>', 'This is a great choice of subject, very interesting, and an engaging character. Composed well also. I think though, that the extreme shadows, and very harsh light on his face and beard (to the point of being blown out) are taking a lot away from the image. It looks like a tough exposure. A case where maybe a different angle would yield more favorable light? Or waiting for a cloud to cross the sun, if even for a moment, to catch a fleeting second of nice diffused light. Or, if this is someone that set''s up there on a regular basis, trying to catch on a different day, or a different time of day to catch some good light?', '2007-07-31 02:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
