(3954296, 562897, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the scene alot, especially the inclusion of the juice bar stand. But the image seems really dark, it has no whites in the photo. If you have a levels adjustment available in editing software, move the right slider which controls the highlights to the beginning of the histogram whichi should be over to the left. Just my opinion, if you like I would leave it but it would help the image I think. You can PM if you would like and I can show you.</td>', 'I like the scene alot, especially the inclusion of the juice bar stand. But the image seems really dark, it has no whites in the photo. If you have a levels adjustment available in editing software, move the right slider which controls the highlights to the beginning of the histogram whichi should be over to the left. Just my opinion, if you like I would leave it but it would help the image I think. You can PM if you would like and I can show you.', '2007-07-31 20:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
