(3958340, 562150, 67258, '<td valign="top">A perfect moment, and good composition.  I kind of like the processing and kind of don''t -how is that for sitting on the fence!  What I like - the level of detail, and the illustration like qualities; what I dislike - the lack of contrast in the shadows, and the illustration like qualities.  Bit of a dichotomy really!<br/>PS  Welcome back, MAK.</td>', 'A perfect moment, and good composition.  I kind of like the processing and kind of don''t -how is that for sitting on the fence!  What I like - the level of detail, and the illustration like qualities; what I dislike - the lack of contrast in the shadows, and the illustration like qualities.  Bit of a dichotomy really!PS  Welcome back, MAK.', '2007-08-01 17:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
