(3960614, 561163, 8860, '<td valign="top">An unusual angle this, with some good shadows which reveal his activity behind the misleading depth of field. <br/> <br/>My immediate observation is that this is over processed for this kind of capture. The blurring looks too soft for the subject and is normally something I''d expect to see on a sentimental wedding shot. The desatutration works well though, but it just needed to be crisper and grittier for this urban scene.</td>', 'An unusual angle this, with some good shadows which reveal his activity behind the misleading depth of field.  My immediate observation is that this is over processed for this kind of capture. The blurring looks too soft for the subject and is normally something I''d expect to see on a sentimental wedding shot. The desatutration works well though, but it just needed to be crisper and grittier for this urban scene.', '2007-08-02 05:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960615, 561767, 77365, '<td valign="top">good tonal range, repetion of patern good, variety with girl even better, black and white conversion good. great work</td>', 'good tonal range, repetion of patern good, variety with girl even better, black and white conversion good. great work', '2007-08-02 05:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960618, 562751, 77365, '<td valign="top">old guys and kids excellent subjects,also a moment time captured with hidden subtext eg Chili and a curious on looker. Excellent work</td>', 'old guys and kids excellent subjects,also a moment time captured with hidden subtext eg Chili and a curious on looker. Excellent work', '2007-08-02 05:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960619, 561332, 77365, '<td valign="top">to fade or not to fade clever shot</td>', 'to fade or not to fade clever shot', '2007-08-02 05:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960620, 562668, 77365, '<td valign="top">go ahead crop the sign,tone is excellent,dark on light light on dark good stuff, yeah crop the sign.</td>', 'go ahead crop the sign,tone is excellent,dark on light light on dark good stuff, yeah crop the sign.', '2007-08-02 05:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960621, 562318, 77365, '<td valign="top">good conversion still alittle flat needs some pop</td>', 'good conversion still alittle flat needs some pop', '2007-08-02 05:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960622, 561866, 77365, '<td valign="top">Love these negative/postive space images a moment in time to boot excellent work adding to my favorites</td>', 'Love these negative/postive space images a moment in time to boot excellent work adding to my favorites', '2007-08-02 06:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960623, 563256, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is quite poorly exposed, focused and lacks an interesting subject. Sorry to sound so negative (and I may not be the first) but there is honestly not much to keep this from a 1, although you have kept the camera straightish!<br/> <br/>Next time you could try panning the camera to capture a subject crisp while all else is moving (the bloke looking at the camera here perhaps). If you use a wide angle lens for this, and are quite close, even subjects on the same moving object will appear blurred apart from a narrow focal point where you track with the camera. <br/> <br/>Otherwise just try to look for a quirk in a scene  particularly using backgrounds for juxtaposition or other subjects to show contrast of lifestyle, etc.</td>', 'This is quite poorly exposed, focused and lacks an interesting subject. Sorry to sound so negative (and I may not be the first) but there is honestly not much to keep this from a 1, although you have kept the camera straightish! Next time you could try panning the camera to capture a subject crisp while all else is moving (the bloke looking at the camera here perhaps). If you use a wide angle lens for this, and are quite close, even subjects on the same moving object will appear blurred apart from a narrow focal point where you track with the camera.  Otherwise just try to look for a quirk in a scene  particularly using backgrounds for juxtaposition or other subjects to show contrast of lifestyle, etc.', '2007-08-02 06:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960625, 562038, 77365, '<td valign="top">I still have to get use to this photoshop effect it is almost creepy i am sure that is not the effect you were after. nice work on low angle</td>', 'I still have to get use to this photoshop effect it is almost creepy i am sure that is not the effect you were after. nice work on low angle', '2007-08-02 06:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960627, 561856, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely spotted. It''s a bit tightly cropped at the bottom and left, but I like this.</td>', 'Nicely spotted. It''s a bit tightly cropped at the bottom and left, but I like this.', '2007-08-02 06:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
