(3960641, 562897, 77365, '<td valign="top">Very CIA like shoot "i have the subject going west no east," ok couldnt help it. i cannot tell if the tone cause this shot to go flat or if it is just in need of levels/curves adjustment, or if my monitor is wonky</td>', 'Very CIA like shoot "i have the subject going west no east," ok couldnt help it. i cannot tell if the tone cause this shot to go flat or if it is just in need of levels/curves adjustment, or if my monitor is wonky', '2007-08-02 06:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
