(3967879, 563119, 62187, '<td valign="top">That IS pretty strange looking!</td>', 'That IS pretty strange looking!', '2007-08-04 07:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3967880, 562363, 62187, '<td valign="top">Why are you putting ideas in peoples heads? It''s a lot more ''Street'' then some of the others. I like the darkness of it and focus is good.</td>', 'Why are you putting ideas in peoples heads? It''s a lot more ''Street'' then some of the others. I like the darkness of it and focus is good.', '2007-08-04 07:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3967887, 562038, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like an excellent photo to me but nothing is saying to me it''s Street Photography. Looks more like somebody out in the woods.</td>', 'Looks like an excellent photo to me but nothing is saying to me it''s Street Photography. Looks more like somebody out in the woods.', '2007-08-04 07:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3967969, 561149, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a great photo and title as well. It kinda gives me a clue as to what score to give it. And that would be: 10</td>', 'What a great photo and title as well. It kinda gives me a clue as to what score to give it. And that would be: 10', '2007-08-04 09:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968026, 563097, 52169, '<td valign="top">very beautiful! 9 and a fav</td>', 'very beautiful! 9 and a fav', '2007-08-04 09:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968261, 563139, 29591, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W conversion, and it works with the scene.</td>', 'Good B&W conversion, and it works with the scene.', '2007-08-04 12:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968264, 562520, 29591, '<td valign="top">The pic is a bit busy and nothing attracts my attention specially.</td>', 'The pic is a bit busy and nothing attracts my attention specially.', '2007-08-04 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968270, 561768, 29591, '<td valign="top">very interesting, I like the composition.</td>', 'very interesting, I like the composition.', '2007-08-04 12:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968274, 563111, 29591, '<td valign="top">It might work better as a B&amp;W, the color version is a bit washed out.</td>', 'It might work better as a B&W, the color version is a bit washed out.', '2007-08-04 12:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968277, 559735, 29591, '<td valign="top">Not really what it comes to mind with "Street photography". But it is a great image.</td>', 'Not really what it comes to mind with "Street photography". But it is a great image.', '2007-08-04 12:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968281, 562910, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the strong horizontal bands cut into by your diagonal subjects.</td>', 'I like the strong horizontal bands cut into by your diagonal subjects.', '2007-08-04 12:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968282, 562429, 29591, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see a bit more of the sax. Good B&amp;W conversion though</td>', 'I would prefer to see a bit more of the sax. Good B&W conversion though', '2007-08-04 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968286, 562053, 29591, '<td valign="top">Whites seem a bit bright, but good capture.</td>', 'Whites seem a bit bright, but good capture.', '2007-08-04 12:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968296, 562774, 31403, '<td valign="top">stunning - love this</td>', 'stunning - love this', '2007-08-04 12:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968303, 561873, 31403, '<td valign="top">the title hurts me - what''s poverty got to do with it? - is the first thing that came to my mind.<br/> <br/>How''s that for insightful photographic critique?<br/> <br/>I''d trade less wall for more lady compositionally.</td>', 'the title hurts me - what''s poverty got to do with it? - is the first thing that came to my mind. How''s that for insightful photographic critique? I''d trade less wall for more lady compositionally.', '2007-08-04 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968311, 563111, 31403, '<td valign="top">if this is the composition - I think the face should be in focus.  Move the violin up in the frame and this focus works for me.  Maybe evening out the exposure with shadow/highlights too?  Hope that helps.</td>', 'if this is the composition - I think the face should be in focus.  Move the violin up in the frame and this focus works for me.  Maybe evening out the exposure with shadow/highlights too?  Hope that helps.', '2007-08-04 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968314, 561767, 31403, '<td valign="top">half a woman got into your beautiful shot!</td>', 'half a woman got into your beautiful shot!', '2007-08-04 12:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968318, 561721, 31403, '<td valign="top">excellent, one of the better street shots in this challenge - I hope you''re doing well with it.  Love the story, love the fact I don''t need the title to see the story.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'excellent, one of the better street shots in this challenge - I hope you''re doing well with it.  Love the story, love the fact I don''t need the title to see the story.  Very nicely done.', '2007-08-04 12:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968319, 562150, 31403, '<td valign="top">brilliant processing, excellent story being told.  8 for now.</td>', 'brilliant processing, excellent story being told.  8 for now.', '2007-08-04 13:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968321, 562766, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture 8 for now</td>', 'beautiful capture 8 for now', '2007-08-04 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968374, 562972, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the sunglasses. :) <br/>Seems a tad oversaturated, though.</td>', 'I like the sunglasses. :) Seems a tad oversaturated, though.', '2007-08-04 13:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968379, 562609, 70, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the processing is much too heavy.</td>', 'Good idea but the processing is much too heavy.', '2007-08-04 13:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969239, 562845, 18765, '<td valign="top">a little fill flash would make this better</td>', 'a little fill flash would make this better', '2007-08-04 21:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969244, 562897, 18765, '<td valign="top">i think the levels need messed with a little bit, and a little more contrast would help</td>', 'i think the levels need messed with a little bit, and a little more contrast would help', '2007-08-04 21:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969248, 561284, 18765, '<td valign="top">i wish you had shot from as low of an angle as you could get</td>', 'i wish you had shot from as low of an angle as you could get', '2007-08-04 21:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969257, 561578, 18765, '<td valign="top">maybe if it wasn''t cropped so tightly it would be more effective, as in the tips of the boards and they are cut off at the knees</td>', 'maybe if it wasn''t cropped so tightly it would be more effective, as in the tips of the boards and they are cut off at the knees', '2007-08-04 21:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969260, 562586, 18765, '<td valign="top">a fix of what?</td>', 'a fix of what?', '2007-08-04 21:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969631, 563155, 13688, '<td valign="top">the more i look at this the more enthralling it becomes.  i still can''t figure out what the deal is with the birds</td>', 'the more i look at this the more enthralling it becomes.  i still can''t figure out what the deal is with the birds', '2007-08-05 00:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969640, 562804, 82254, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and timing on the subject. Deserves 10</td>', 'Excellent composition and timing on the subject. Deserves 10', '2007-08-05 00:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969643, 563164, 82254, '<td valign="top">I give a 7.</td>', 'I give a 7.', '2007-08-05 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969654, 562202, 82254, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the subject with balance in the picture introducing the bird. Deserves 8.</td>', 'Nice detail in the subject with balance in the picture introducing the bird. Deserves 8.', '2007-08-05 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969739, 562804, 50695, '<td valign="top">I am most definitely not a fan of Joey Lawrence homeless people, but this is different. This guy has struck a pose, and not just any pose. He is Saint Francis receiving the stigmata. This is classical art.</td>', 'I am most definitely not a fan of Joey Lawrence homeless people, but this is different. This guy has struck a pose, and not just any pose. He is Saint Francis receiving the stigmata. This is classical art.', '2007-08-05 00:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969759, 562346, 50695, '<td valign="top">The hair on his face transforms him into a wave in front of Mt. Fuji. You are a thief, a kidnapper and a magician.</td>', 'The hair on his face transforms him into a wave in front of Mt. Fuji. You are a thief, a kidnapper and a magician.', '2007-08-05 01:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969764, 563016, 50695, '<td valign="top">Those kids faces look a little too neat-imaged, and then there''s the vignetting. Too bad, because that kid on the right is making a priceless expression. I''ll give you a 7, but the points really belong to him.</td>', 'Those kids faces look a little too neat-imaged, and then there''s the vignetting. Too bad, because that kid on the right is making a priceless expression. I''ll give you a 7, but the points really belong to him.', '2007-08-05 01:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969767, 561671, 50695, '<td valign="top">Fascinating, strange image.</td>', 'Fascinating, strange image.', '2007-08-05 01:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969768, 562520, 50695, '<td valign="top">His head rest looks like a jowl on his face. I find this very distracting for some reason. Perhaps you could do something in PP to negate this effect.</td>', 'His head rest looks like a jowl on his face. I find this very distracting for some reason. Perhaps you could do something in PP to negate this effect.', '2007-08-05 01:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969771, 562982, 50695, '<td valign="top">7 for telling a story.</td>', '7 for telling a story.', '2007-08-05 01:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969773, 563272, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely, joyful photo.</td>', 'lovely, joyful photo.', '2007-08-05 01:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969776, 563133, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder what this would look like in black and white. I have a feeling it would look like he was reaching out from another world. Great capture.</td>', 'I have to wonder what this would look like in black and white. I have a feeling it would look like he was reaching out from another world. Great capture.', '2007-08-05 01:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969780, 561284, 50695, '<td valign="top">great parallels between man and dog, which are in complementary thirds positions. Great composition.</td>', 'great parallels between man and dog, which are in complementary thirds positions. Great composition.', '2007-08-05 01:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969782, 562952, 50695, '<td valign="top">It really does look like she is hearing a call. She looks almost saintly.</td>', 'It really does look like she is hearing a call. She looks almost saintly.', '2007-08-05 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969789, 563155, 50695, '<td valign="top">strange and fascinating photo. what is real and what is fake? who is watching whom?</td>', 'strange and fascinating photo. what is real and what is fake? who is watching whom?', '2007-08-05 01:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969793, 563277, 50695, '<td valign="top">dynamic composition and having him be "lost" in her seems to have metaphorical implications.</td>', 'dynamic composition and having him be "lost" in her seems to have metaphorical implications.', '2007-08-05 01:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969795, 561339, 50695, '<td valign="top">these characters seem defined by where they look. interesting theme. the composition gives a remarkable power to his gaze.</td>', 'these characters seem defined by where they look. interesting theme. the composition gives a remarkable power to his gaze.', '2007-08-05 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969797, 562847, 50695, '<td valign="top">vignetting is a little too obvious for me. I don''t know why this needs vignetting.</td>', 'vignetting is a little too obvious for me. I don''t know why this needs vignetting.', '2007-08-05 01:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969799, 562906, 50695, '<td valign="top">far out!</td>', 'far out!', '2007-08-05 01:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969800, 561149, 50695, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve gotten below the street, like we''re seeing the bottom of the street. I always appreciate a new perspective. 10</td>', 'It looks like you''ve gotten below the street, like we''re seeing the bottom of the street. I always appreciate a new perspective. 10', '2007-08-05 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969802, 562793, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t think those eggs are going to roll down the street very well. Stunning composition.</td>', 'I don''t think those eggs are going to roll down the street very well. Stunning composition.', '2007-08-05 01:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969803, 562751, 50695, '<td valign="top">This looks like a collage, like people from four different worlds confronting each other and the photographer. A stunning vision. 10</td>', 'This looks like a collage, like people from four different worlds confronting each other and the photographer. A stunning vision. 10', '2007-08-05 01:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969804, 562766, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not just a great motion capture, but also a composition for the ages, as though a boy leapt into an abstract painting... and the boy remained a boy... and the painting remained abstract. It''s the sort of impossibility, the sort of miracle, that I expect from a photograph. 10</td>', 'Not just a great motion capture, but also a composition for the ages, as though a boy leapt into an abstract painting... and the boy remained a boy... and the painting remained abstract. It''s the sort of impossibility, the sort of miracle, that I expect from a photograph. 10', '2007-08-05 01:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969806, 561866, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate vignetting but this seems to be an actual highlight on the street. It''s thrilling to see a vignette that is the result of light and framing. The photo is so simple as to be crude, but its textures are complex. Are those petals on the ground? They are solid and liquid and starry all at the same time. The bird draws all the attention, but then while being stared at, it stops being a bird, and dissolves with its shadow into shapes and curves and lines... then rises up and becomes a bird again. 10</td>', 'I hate vignetting but this seems to be an actual highlight on the street. It''s thrilling to see a vignette that is the result of light and framing. The photo is so simple as to be crude, but its textures are complex. Are those petals on the ground? They are solid and liquid and starry all at the same time. The bird draws all the attention, but then while being stared at, it stops being a bird, and dissolves with its shadow into shapes and curves and lines... then rises up and becomes a bird again. 10', '2007-08-05 01:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969807, 562476, 50695, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the diner at AMC Theaters in midtown Manhattan. The thought that you found such beauty in such a vacuous, mundane place astounds me. The man seems about to be ground into the gears of some fiersome geometry. 10</td>', 'This reminds me of the diner at AMC Theaters in midtown Manhattan. The thought that you found such beauty in such a vacuous, mundane place astounds me. The man seems about to be ground into the gears of some fiersome geometry. 10', '2007-08-05 01:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969808, 563283, 50695, '<td valign="top">That woman is phenomenal. A goddess, or so you have made her. The way you''ve tucked her to the side and left room for all this mundane crap on the left is truly inspired. She seems to be the Goddess of Time, clutching it with both hands as it grinds into the quotidian abyss. 10</td>', 'That woman is phenomenal. A goddess, or so you have made her. The way you''ve tucked her to the side and left room for all this mundane crap on the left is truly inspired. She seems to be the Goddess of Time, clutching it with both hands as it grinds into the quotidian abyss. 10', '2007-08-05 01:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969809, 562897, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps the most <i>immersive</i> photo in the challenge. Beyond being a picture of the street, it puts me in the street. And I can barely keep my head above it! Such energy! And your title allows a little ironic distance, like the perfect palate cleanser. 10</td>', 'This is perhaps the most immersive photo in the challenge. Beyond being a picture of the street, it puts me in the street. And I can barely keep my head above it! Such energy! And your title allows a little ironic distance, like the perfect palate cleanser. 10', '2007-08-05 01:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969811, 562774, 50695, '<td valign="top">The beauty of this struck me immediately, the moving forms, the diagonal lines and diagonalness of the composition. But then I saw the title and realized I was witnessing the joy of a child. So touching. 10</td>', 'The beauty of this struck me immediately, the moving forms, the diagonal lines and diagonalness of the composition. But then I saw the title and realized I was witnessing the joy of a child. So touching. 10', '2007-08-05 01:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969812, 563097, 50695, '<td valign="top">I contain multitudes. This is a photograph Walt Whitman would take. It is truly astounding. For taking a picture that I cannot understand or conceive, I can only give you the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. It is my only recourse!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077284" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-09-20 20:11:50.</i></td>', 'I contain multitudes. This is a photograph Walt Whitman would take. It is truly astounding. For taking a picture that I cannot understand or conceive, I can only give you the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. It is my only recourse! ', '2007-08-05 01:19:32.000000', '2016-09-20 21:11:50.000000', 1),
(3969813, 561163, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate skateboarding pictures. Luckily, this isn''t a skateboarding picture. It is a picture of flight and its terrific tangle with fate. 10</td>', 'I hate skateboarding pictures. Luckily, this isn''t a skateboarding picture. It is a picture of flight and its terrific tangle with fate. 10', '2007-08-05 01:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969815, 562066, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is what motion panning is all about. The sense of immersion is palpable. The splashes are tangible. This is just brilliant, ecstatic photography. 10</td>', 'This is what motion panning is all about. The sense of immersion is palpable. The splashes are tangible. This is just brilliant, ecstatic photography. 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969816, 562517, 50695, '<td valign="top">Compelling title and angle. This is a poem masquerading as a bumper sticker. 10</td>', 'Compelling title and angle. This is a poem masquerading as a bumper sticker. 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969817, 562100, 50695, '<td valign="top">AFter about three or four viewings, I see a zipper on her jacket. Not a gawdy intrusion, mind you, just an amusing reminder that yesterday comes wrapped in today. 10</td>', 'AFter about three or four viewings, I see a zipper on her jacket. Not a gawdy intrusion, mind you, just an amusing reminder that yesterday comes wrapped in today. 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969818, 562651, 50695, '<td valign="top">an album cover, a musical comedy, a moment of clarity, a drink of water. 10</td>', 'an album cover, a musical comedy, a moment of clarity, a drink of water. 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969819, 562652, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the composition with the broken stick struggles against the reality of what we''re seeing: the strong, living legs of the players. For me, a picture doesn''t have to be perfect to get a 10. It just has to go somewhere new, and go there with a certain amount of style and/or a certain boldness. 10</td>', 'I like how the composition with the broken stick struggles against the reality of what we''re seeing: the strong, living legs of the players. For me, a picture doesn''t have to be perfect to get a 10. It just has to go somewhere new, and go there with a certain amount of style and/or a certain boldness. 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969821, 561144, 50695, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture, suggesting so much more than what is pictured about the world this was taken in. 10</td>', 'Terrific capture, suggesting so much more than what is pictured about the world this was taken in. 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969822, 562771, 50695, '<td valign="top">amazing juxtaposition. She looks more real than he does! 10</td>', 'amazing juxtaposition. She looks more real than he does! 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969823, 563123, 50695, '<td valign="top">Man Ray Meets Wee Gee 10</td>', 'Man Ray Meets Wee Gee 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969824, 561221, 50695, '<td valign="top">I always hesitate to vote sculptures high. On the other hand this has so much more going for it, from the complementary pose of the other sitter to the phenomenal reflections behind them. Still, so much of the heart of this picture comes from that statue. But so what? It''s wonderful when art is collaborative. 10</td>', 'I always hesitate to vote sculptures high. On the other hand this has so much more going for it, from the complementary pose of the other sitter to the phenomenal reflections behind them. Still, so much of the heart of this picture comes from that statue. But so what? It''s wonderful when art is collaborative. 10', '2007-08-05 01:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969825, 562803, 50695, '<td valign="top">remarkable portrait and a unique perspective on street, looking outward from the cozy indoors.</td>', 'remarkable portrait and a unique perspective on street, looking outward from the cozy indoors.', '2007-08-05 01:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969826, 560039, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, there is a simple joy to this. It looks as though you''ve caught the woman in mid-flight, just like the birds.</td>', 'Yes, there is a simple joy to this. It looks as though you''ve caught the woman in mid-flight, just like the birds.', '2007-08-05 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969827, 561873, 50695, '<td valign="top">great composition, with the diagonal created by the two people and the way the frame is cut in half. then there is the energy she takes right out of frame with her eyes, while he remains a model of stoic grace. For all its fragmented quality, this image looks permanent, inevitable.</td>', 'great composition, with the diagonal created by the two people and the way the frame is cut in half. then there is the energy she takes right out of frame with her eyes, while he remains a model of stoic grace. For all its fragmented quality, this image looks permanent, inevitable.', '2007-08-05 01:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969828, 563139, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of how photography is not real. This moment does not exist, never existed. This boy was never frozen here, contemplating his own mortality contrasted with the pitiless concrete. He was in motion, intense motion, living perhaps without thought at that very moment. Your vision is inauthentic, imperfect and vastly more interesting. Art, in other words, in all its ineffectuality and brilliance.</td>', 'This is a great example of how photography is not real. This moment does not exist, never existed. This boy was never frozen here, contemplating his own mortality contrasted with the pitiless concrete. He was in motion, intense motion, living perhaps without thought at that very moment. Your vision is inauthentic, imperfect and vastly more interesting. Art, in other words, in all its ineffectuality and brilliance.', '2007-08-05 01:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3969834, 563119, 50695, '<td valign="top">Stunning, disorienting, this photo does not exist anywhere and yet seems to come from the past, and evokes many themes, none quite taking it over, so that it remains at its heart a mystery. 10<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon:<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>(edited to fix the image)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-06 08:44:57.</i></td>', 'Stunning, disorienting, this photo does not exist anywhere and yet seems to come from the past, and evokes many themes, none quite taking it over, so that it remains at its heart a mystery. 10 Posthumous Red Ribbon:  (edited to fix the image)', '2007-08-05 01:23:04.000000', '2007-08-06 09:44:57.000000', 1),
(3969837, 561020, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great energy and storytelling. and what a wonderful smile! and look, the decisive moment... right before the grab... 10<br/> <br/>a deceptively perfect photograph<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Great energy and storytelling. and what a wonderful smile! and look, the decisive moment... right before the grab... 10 a deceptively perfect photograph Posthumous Yellow Ribbon', '2007-08-05 01:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
