(3970907, 563143, 35304, '<td valign="top">Very impressive.  this photograph personifies the concept of Street Photography.<br/> <br/>The Street Artist by the way, is no Slouch!</td>', 'Very impressive.  this photograph personifies the concept of Street Photography. The Street Artist by the way, is no Slouch!', '2007-08-05 15:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3970972, 562263, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but the selective desat in this shot makes no sense to me...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry but the selective desat in this shot makes no sense to me...TC', '2007-08-05 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971071, 562878, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good setup and exposure.</td>', 'Good setup and exposure.', '2007-08-05 17:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971073, 562976, 57032, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, and it keeps me interested by forcing me to look around. The shadows all along the wall are a bit distracting.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, and it keeps me interested by forcing me to look around. The shadows all along the wall are a bit distracting.', '2007-08-05 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971074, 562574, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good detail in his face. Colour tones are excellent. Good contrast, exposure, and mood.</td>', 'Good detail in his face. Colour tones are excellent. Good contrast, exposure, and mood.', '2007-08-05 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971075, 561578, 57032, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and colour. Faces are a bit blurry.</td>', 'Excellent composition and colour. Faces are a bit blurry.', '2007-08-05 17:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971078, 561332, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the smoke. Nice, clear image with good contrast. The bottom right corner is distracting; it looks like you either rotated the image and didn''t crop, or caught a sliver of a wall.</td>', 'Good capture of the smoke. Nice, clear image with good contrast. The bottom right corner is distracting; it looks like you either rotated the image and didn''t crop, or caught a sliver of a wall.', '2007-08-05 17:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971080, 562854, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great capture of mood. The background is sufficiently blurred. Excellent timing.</td>', 'Great capture of mood. The background is sufficiently blurred. Excellent timing.', '2007-08-05 17:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971081, 562450, 57032, '<td valign="top">You have portrayed the mood of the scene very well with the blur and vignette. Nice job.</td>', 'You have portrayed the mood of the scene very well with the blur and vignette. Nice job.', '2007-08-05 17:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971084, 561284, 57032, '<td valign="top">The top half of the image doesn''t do much for me, but a perfect capture of the dog. A crop from the seats down might have been a bit more effective in my opinion. Still, excellent job and nice contrast.</td>', 'The top half of the image doesn''t do much for me, but a perfect capture of the dog. A crop from the seats down might have been a bit more effective in my opinion. Still, excellent job and nice contrast.', '2007-08-05 17:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971086, 562093, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Well composed.</td>', 'Good shot. Well composed.', '2007-08-05 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971087, 562554, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good background blur. It''s a bit dizzying, but it pulls me into the scene. Nice job.</td>', 'Good background blur. It''s a bit dizzying, but it pulls me into the scene. Nice job.', '2007-08-05 17:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971089, 562220, 57032, '<td valign="top">His emotion comes through very strongly. Nice, clear capture.</td>', 'His emotion comes through very strongly. Nice, clear capture.', '2007-08-05 17:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971090, 562429, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very clear where it needs to be. Nice contrast.</td>', 'Very clear where it needs to be. Nice contrast.', '2007-08-05 17:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971091, 562758, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours. A bit blurry in the front boat, but overall a good shot.</td>', 'Very nice colours. A bit blurry in the front boat, but overall a good shot.', '2007-08-05 17:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971094, 563003, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good use of the tree for perspective. A nice, happy shot with clean lines.</td>', 'Good use of the tree for perspective. A nice, happy shot with clean lines.', '2007-08-05 17:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971096, 561149, 57032, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting! What a great shot with a good sense of adventure.</td>', 'Perfect lighting! What a great shot with a good sense of adventure.', '2007-08-05 17:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971097, 563018, 57032, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and good timing.</td>', 'Excellent composition and good timing.', '2007-08-05 17:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971099, 561850, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Exposure is good, though the spotty sunlight is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good shot. Exposure is good, though the spotty sunlight is a bit distracting.', '2007-08-05 17:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971101, 562100, 57032, '<td valign="top">Pretty good lighting. It seems like the kind of shot that tends to score well on DPC, but lacks the punch of some of them. Perhaps a tighter crop?</td>', 'Pretty good lighting. It seems like the kind of shot that tends to score well on DPC, but lacks the punch of some of them. Perhaps a tighter crop?', '2007-08-05 17:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971102, 562086, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very good capture of emotion.</td>', 'Very good capture of emotion.', '2007-08-05 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971103, 562518, 57032, '<td valign="top">The bricks look great in this shot. The sign in the bottom right is distracting. The boys look a bit blurry.</td>', 'The bricks look great in this shot. The sign in the bottom right is distracting. The boys look a bit blurry.', '2007-08-05 17:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971106, 562806, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very soulful eyes. Good composition and contrast.</td>', 'Very soulful eyes. Good composition and contrast.', '2007-08-05 17:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971108, 562751, 57032, '<td valign="top">A pretty good capture with a lot going on. Good depth of field.</td>', 'A pretty good capture with a lot going on. Good depth of field.', '2007-08-05 17:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971110, 562616, 57032, '<td valign="top">Cute smile. It looks like the focus might be behind the statue, rather than the girl''s face.</td>', 'Cute smile. It looks like the focus might be behind the statue, rather than the girl''s face.', '2007-08-05 17:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971113, 563101, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, although the selective desaturation is a bit distracting and doesn''t seem to add to the image. Good exposure.</td>', 'Nice capture, although the selective desaturation is a bit distracting and doesn''t seem to add to the image. Good exposure.', '2007-08-05 17:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971114, 562848, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and mood.</td>', 'Nice colours and mood.', '2007-08-05 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971115, 562476, 57032, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective. Good contrast.</td>', 'An interesting perspective. Good contrast.', '2007-08-05 17:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971116, 562527, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good timing and composition.</td>', 'Good timing and composition.', '2007-08-05 17:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971119, 562651, 57032, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect. Marks for creativity.</td>', 'An interesting effect. Marks for creativity.', '2007-08-05 17:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971121, 562897, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good timing and well exposed.</td>', 'Good timing and well exposed.', '2007-08-05 18:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971123, 562520, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good composition and exposure. Not sure what the guy in the background was pointing at...</td>', 'Good composition and exposure. Not sure what the guy in the background was pointing at...', '2007-08-05 18:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971126, 562771, 57032, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Looks like a corrected fisheye judging by the squares in the sidewalk and the can, but good job of keeping the man''s proportions accurate.</td>', 'Well composed. Looks like a corrected fisheye judging by the squares in the sidewalk and the can, but good job of keeping the man''s proportions accurate.', '2007-08-05 18:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971129, 561619, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, timing, and composition. You''ve actually made the C-Train look half interesting!</td>', 'Nice contrast, timing, and composition. You''ve actually made the C-Train look half interesting!', '2007-08-05 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971130, 562252, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good timing and use of blur.</td>', 'Good timing and use of blur.', '2007-08-05 18:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971131, 560073, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice use of overexposure. It might have looked better if the woman on the left was fully backlit, too.</td>', 'Nice use of overexposure. It might have looked better if the woman on the left was fully backlit, too.', '2007-08-05 18:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971133, 562970, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good timing, and well framed by the door. It carries mood, but the dirty window is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good timing, and well framed by the door. It carries mood, but the dirty window is a bit distracting.', '2007-08-05 18:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971134, 563151, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, but there''s no sense of why she''s his "prize".</td>', 'Good exposure, but there''s no sense of why she''s his "prize".', '2007-08-05 18:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971136, 562910, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. The title tries to tell a bit too much. A bit blurry throughout.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. The title tries to tell a bit too much. A bit blurry throughout.', '2007-08-05 18:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971138, 562979, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good colour tone and exposure.</td>', 'Good colour tone and exposure.', '2007-08-05 18:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971140, 562793, 57032, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of emotion. A perfect title, albeit spelled wrong.</td>', 'Excellent capture of emotion. A perfect title, albeit spelled wrong.', '2007-08-05 18:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971142, 563205, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great composition, particularly the inclusion of the writing in the background. Good clarity in the face. A bit of an odd expression, but still cute. Good shot.</td>', 'Great composition, particularly the inclusion of the writing in the background. Good clarity in the face. A bit of an odd expression, but still cute. Good shot.', '2007-08-05 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971145, 563244, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good capture with a lot to look at. Good exposure.</td>', 'Good capture with a lot to look at. Good exposure.', '2007-08-05 18:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971148, 562606, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good capture of emotion. Well exposed.</td>', 'Good capture of emotion. Well exposed.', '2007-08-05 18:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971150, 563155, 57032, '<td valign="top">The moment is well captured, although the ladies in the front are a bit distracting, as is the blown out sky. B&amp;W is effective here.</td>', 'The moment is well captured, although the ladies in the front are a bit distracting, as is the blown out sky. B&W is effective here.', '2007-08-05 18:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971151, 562977, 57032, '<td valign="top">Dark, but it portrays the mood well. A bit contrasty.</td>', 'Dark, but it portrays the mood well. A bit contrasty.', '2007-08-05 18:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971162, 563215, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal of mood, and nicely exposed.</td>', 'Good portrayal of mood, and nicely exposed.', '2007-08-05 18:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971163, 562038, 57032, '<td valign="top">A very crisp shot with good exposure.</td>', 'A very crisp shot with good exposure.', '2007-08-05 18:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971165, 563217, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and good composition.</td>', 'Nice effect and good composition.', '2007-08-05 18:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971168, 559542, 57032, '<td valign="top">Well composed. A bit contrasty.</td>', 'Well composed. A bit contrasty.', '2007-08-05 18:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971170, 562902, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great timing.</td>', 'Great timing.', '2007-08-05 18:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971171, 562971, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and good colours.</td>', 'Very crisp and good colours.', '2007-08-05 18:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971179, 563199, 57032, '<td valign="top">Blurry throughout. No sense of subject.</td>', 'Blurry throughout. No sense of subject.', '2007-08-05 18:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971182, 563014, 57032, '<td valign="top">Distracting background. Doesn''t come across as much of an "elder".</td>', 'Distracting background. Doesn''t come across as much of an "elder".', '2007-08-05 18:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971183, 562351, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but blurry.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, but blurry.', '2007-08-05 18:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971185, 562625, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Nice colour.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Nice colour.', '2007-08-05 18:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971187, 563275, 57032, '<td valign="top">It seems like a quick snapshot, and only the plants appear to be crisp. Perhaps a B&amp;W would have fared well here.</td>', 'It seems like a quick snapshot, and only the plants appear to be crisp. Perhaps a B&W would have fared well here.', '2007-08-05 18:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971188, 562213, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but his face is blurry or has too flat of contrast to really see it.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but his face is blurry or has too flat of contrast to really see it.', '2007-08-05 18:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971190, 562559, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. A bit contrasty.</td>', 'Interesting composition. A bit contrasty.', '2007-08-05 18:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971195, 563042, 57032, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t determine where the camera had focused here, and the background is a bit distracting. It doesn''t convey much emotion to me.</td>', 'I couldn''t determine where the camera had focused here, and the background is a bit distracting. It doesn''t convey much emotion to me.', '2007-08-05 18:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971196, 562565, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but there''s no clear subject in focus.</td>', 'Nice colours, but there''s no clear subject in focus.', '2007-08-05 18:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971203, 562982, 57032, '<td valign="top">A bit staged for this particular challenge. The background is distracting, and it seems a bit like a quick snapshot. Her face could have been better lit.</td>', 'A bit staged for this particular challenge. The background is distracting, and it seems a bit like a quick snapshot. Her face could have been better lit.', '2007-08-05 18:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971206, 561943, 57032, '<td valign="top">The blown highlights on the beard, nose, and cheekbone are distracting. Good composition. Interesting shot.</td>', 'The blown highlights on the beard, nose, and cheekbone are distracting. Good composition. Interesting shot.', '2007-08-05 18:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971209, 562318, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good perspective. Might have been better if the crop was tighter.</td>', 'Good perspective. Might have been better if the crop was tighter.', '2007-08-05 18:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971211, 562846, 57032, '<td valign="top">The girls are dark and blurry, and the highlights are blown in the background. It would fare better without the guy in the picture and if the girls were in focus, in my opinion.</td>', 'The girls are dark and blurry, and the highlights are blown in the background. It would fare better without the guy in the picture and if the girls were in focus, in my opinion.', '2007-08-05 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971213, 563283, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the title seems forced to fit the image.</td>', 'Good composition, but the title seems forced to fit the image.', '2007-08-05 18:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971216, 563256, 57032, '<td valign="top">Blurry, and the reflection is distracting.</td>', 'Blurry, and the reflection is distracting.', '2007-08-05 18:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971219, 562862, 57032, '<td valign="top">The food is overexposed, and focus seems to be behind the woman.</td>', 'The food is overexposed, and focus seems to be behind the woman.', '2007-08-05 18:40:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3971222, 563097, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but the reflections seem to make it too busy of an image.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but the reflections seem to make it too busy of an image.', '2007-08-05 18:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971223, 562463, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and composition is interesting.</td>', 'Good exposure and composition is interesting.', '2007-08-05 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971224, 562214, 57032, '<td valign="top">Has the feel of a quick snapshot. Lighting of the subjects is okay.</td>', 'Has the feel of a quick snapshot. Lighting of the subjects is okay.', '2007-08-05 18:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971244, 561850, 51597, '<td valign="top">Theme of foto put together well via a young man sitting apart from the older man.. The pidgeons  scattered about lead one to streets of cities.</td>', 'Theme of foto put together well via a young man sitting apart from the older man.. The pidgeons  scattered about lead one to streets of cities.', '2007-08-05 18:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971248, 562625, 51597, '<td valign="top">I must have a different concept of street photography that the rest of the world.. Doesn''t quite fit for me but it''s a nice foto..</td>', 'I must have a different concept of street photography that the rest of the world.. Doesn''t quite fit for me but it''s a nice foto..', '2007-08-05 18:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971253, 562252, 51597, '<td valign="top">Not my cup of tea... Well edited tho..</td>', 'Not my cup of tea... Well edited tho..', '2007-08-05 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971257, 562849, 51597, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous foto.. Not quite my concept of street photography.. <br/>Good luck~</td>', 'Gorgeous foto.. Not quite my concept of street photography.. Good luck~', '2007-08-05 18:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971262, 561839, 51597, '<td valign="top">Good ----The subject stands in the forefront contemplating and the hustle &amp; bustle near yet far, Sets him apart..<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Good ----The subject stands in the forefront contemplating and the hustle & bustle near yet far, Sets him apart..Well done.', '2007-08-05 18:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971267, 562906, 1897, '<td valign="top">nice dynamic shot.   The coolers look nice and saturated</td>', 'nice dynamic shot.   The coolers look nice and saturated', '2007-08-05 19:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971317, 562252, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great color and movement...kind of funny how the heads completely disappear on long exposures.  Very nice!</td>', 'Great color and movement...kind of funny how the heads completely disappear on long exposures.  Very nice!', '2007-08-05 19:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971328, 562517, 42100, '<td valign="top">The different spots of interest through all the busyness is neat.  Interesting photo!</td>', 'The different spots of interest through all the busyness is neat.  Interesting photo!', '2007-08-05 19:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971330, 562902, 42100, '<td valign="top">Lots of great interest in the expressions of the subjects in this photo.  Very nice b&amp;w conversion as well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Lots of great interest in the expressions of the subjects in this photo.  Very nice b&w conversion as well.  Nicely done!', '2007-08-05 19:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971335, 561578, 42100, '<td valign="top">This could be anywhere in the world, but I can''t help but think southern California with the look and attitude.  Great photo...you really isolated the girls from background perfectly!</td>', 'This could be anywhere in the world, but I can''t help but think southern California with the look and attitude.  Great photo...you really isolated the girls from background perfectly!', '2007-08-05 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971340, 561221, 42100, '<td valign="top">Definitely a multi-layered photograph with the primary subject...and then all the great activity happening in the reflections.  Well done!</td>', 'Definitely a multi-layered photograph with the primary subject...and then all the great activity happening in the reflections.  Well done!', '2007-08-05 19:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971342, 562906, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion in this with the blur...very interesting photograph subject-wise as well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great sense of motion in this with the blur...very interesting photograph subject-wise as well.  Nicely done!', '2007-08-05 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971448, 562793, 22301, '<td valign="top">when you betray the secrets of Zeus, be prepared for that uphill battle. 10 great image</td>', 'when you betray the secrets of Zeus, be prepared for that uphill battle. 10 great image', '2007-08-05 20:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971449, 562196, 22301, '<td valign="top">instant fav from me, can''t add to why really, I just love it. Hope to see this on the front page.</td>', 'instant fav from me, can''t add to why really, I just love it. Hope to see this on the front page.', '2007-08-05 20:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971471, 563118, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the artwork.  The graffiti color is bright and fabulous.</td>', 'Love the artwork.  The graffiti color is bright and fabulous.', '2007-08-05 21:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971475, 562976, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the selective desat and the guy just kind of staring into the colorful crowd.</td>', 'I like the selective desat and the guy just kind of staring into the colorful crowd.', '2007-08-05 21:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971476, 562450, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the soft glow of the lights.</td>', 'I like the soft glow of the lights.', '2007-08-05 21:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971478, 563199, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting capture but the blur does not work for me.  I would rather have seen something in focus and the blur being attributed to the reflections of moving people.</td>', 'This is an interesting capture but the blur does not work for me.  I would rather have seen something in focus and the blur being attributed to the reflections of moving people.', '2007-08-05 21:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971482, 561163, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Love how the signs contrast with his motion.</td>', 'Great title.  Love how the signs contrast with his motion.', '2007-08-05 21:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971485, 562303, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective desat.  I like how you used that and the blur of the walkers to convey a story of society.</td>', 'Great use of selective desat.  I like how you used that and the blur of the walkers to convey a story of society.', '2007-08-05 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971487, 561548, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow - quite a comparison/contrast.</td>', 'Wow - quite a comparison/contrast.', '2007-08-05 21:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971489, 562160, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the color tones of the pic.  It seems like there is quite a story to be told here.</td>', 'Love the color tones of the pic.  It seems like there is quite a story to be told here.', '2007-08-05 21:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971491, 562520, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the focus is the guy and his dog but for some reason, the person that really catches my attention is the guy in the white hat.  What is he doing with his hand? lol</td>', 'I''m assuming the focus is the guy and his dog but for some reason, the person that really catches my attention is the guy in the white hat.  What is he doing with his hand? lol', '2007-08-05 21:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971493, 562963, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on him and how he stands out from the background.</td>', 'I like the focus on him and how he stands out from the background.', '2007-08-05 21:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971495, 562517, 67697, '<td valign="top">I see the person on the ground but for some reason Col. Sanders really jumps out in the pic lol.  I love your perspective - as if to bring us down to ground level.</td>', 'I see the person on the ground but for some reason Col. Sanders really jumps out in the pic lol.  I love your perspective - as if to bring us down to ground level.', '2007-08-05 21:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
