(3972645, 562038, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks like an excellent photo to me but nothing is saying to me it''s Street Photography. Looks more like somebody out in the woods. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I KNEW this was going to happen eventually. I''ll NEVER make another comment again! };&gt;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nah....don''t be silly.  At least I ticked yours....some of the others I didn''t!</td>', 'Originally posted by Blackbox: Originally posted by Blackbox: Looks like an excellent photo to me but nothing is saying to me it''s Street Photography. Looks more like somebody out in the woods.   I KNEW this was going to happen eventually. I''ll NEVER make another comment again! };>)   Nah....don''t be silly.  At least I ticked yours....some of the others I didn''t!', '2007-08-06 03:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
