(3972653, 562804, 57260, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Really tells a story. Congratulations on the 5th finish. Personally I do like the B&amp;W version better. I believe that if colour is not essential to the theme of the picture, b&amp;w simplifies the image and causes less distractions thereby focussing one''s attention on the story - just my personal opinion.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Really tells a story. Congratulations on the 5th finish. Personally I do like the B&W version better. I believe that if colour is not essential to the theme of the picture, b&w simplifies the image and causes less distractions thereby focussing one''s attention on the story - just my personal opinion.', '2007-08-06 03:29:16.000000', NULL, 0),
