(3973191, 562857, 53147, '<td valign="top">I have been doing real bad at commenting lately - especially during the vote. I tend to just mark favorites and then come back after the challenge is over to see whose they were. This was one of my 5 9s in this challenge. Great colors, love the soft motion blur, cool lines and shadows - and what can one say about the graffiti. I had hoped to see this higher but a 6+ score is nothing to sneeze at. Very nice work indeed.</td>', 'I have been doing real bad at commenting lately - especially during the vote. I tend to just mark favorites and then come back after the challenge is over to see whose they were. This was one of my 5 9s in this challenge. Great colors, love the soft motion blur, cool lines and shadows - and what can one say about the graffiti. I had hoped to see this higher but a 6+ score is nothing to sneeze at. Very nice work indeed.', '2007-08-06 08:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
