(3973526, 562897, 67697, '<td valign="top">This IS a great shot. (I gave it a 6).  You do a good job of putting the viewer right in the middle of things.  It''s amazing to see such a busy crowd moving along the tight space like this.  It''s excellent that you caught a guy who is drinking something and then that sign is in the back.<br/> <br/>Do take up <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=22301" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jdannels</a> PM offer on getting instructions for using levels.  (I use levels and brightness/contrast.)  You''ll love the difference you''ll see in the pic.</td>', 'This IS a great shot. (I gave it a 6).  You do a good job of putting the viewer right in the middle of things.  It''s amazing to see such a busy crowd moving along the tight space like this.  It''s excellent that you caught a guy who is drinking something and then that sign is in the back. Do take up  jdannels PM offer on getting instructions for using levels.  (I use levels and brightness/contrast.)  You''ll love the difference you''ll see in the pic.', '2007-08-06 09:57:03.000000', NULL, 0),
