(3974289, 563003, 79090, '<td valign="top">i just want to comment on this photo again. Hands down, the best photo in the challenge. A favorite. I hope you realize(as i see you wished it would do better) that this IS the best image of the contest. It sucks it wasn''t rated that way and that is only due to DPC voters favorability in sensationalism.</td>', 'i just want to comment on this photo again. Hands down, the best photo in the challenge. A favorite. I hope you realize(as i see you wished it would do better) that this IS the best image of the contest. It sucks it wasn''t rated that way and that is only due to DPC voters favorability in sensationalism.', '2007-08-06 14:53:38.000000', NULL, 0),
