(3974525, 559662, 66384, '<td valign="top">Marvelous photo and statement. I am very surprised at the score. I guess there were two factors: no people and not b&amp;w. Well the color is what I like about this very lively shot of your dead downtown, and the lack of people is the statement. So the point is made and very nicely at that.</td>', 'Marvelous photo and statement. I am very surprised at the score. I guess there were two factors: no people and not b&w. Well the color is what I like about this very lively shot of your dead downtown, and the lack of people is the statement. So the point is made and very nicely at that.', '2007-08-06 16:29:40.000000', NULL, 0);
