(3975153, 563219, 66384, '<td valign="top">I am amazed at this score. I think the tones, and composition are excellent. I wouldn''t have thought of slanting the shot the way you did, but I really like that. I also like the perspective -- looking up at the subject. Perhaps the soft focus is what hurt the score.</td>', 'I am amazed at this score. I think the tones, and composition are excellent. I wouldn''t have thought of slanting the shot the way you did, but I really like that. I also like the perspective -- looking up at the subject. Perhaps the soft focus is what hurt the score.', '2007-08-06 21:12:27.000000', NULL, 0),
