(3976959, 563290, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cool capture.  I like how the people in the advertisement look like they are staring you down inside your bus lol.  Also neat is that it looks like that passenger is staring back at the billboard.  More good stuff, Sevil!</td>', 'Cool capture.  I like how the people in the advertisement look like they are staring you down inside your bus lol.  Also neat is that it looks like that passenger is staring back at the billboard.  More good stuff, Sevil!', '2007-08-07 12:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
