(3977355, 559662, 57229, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Ya boo etc to the nay sayers. I think I might have tried to rotate so the fence, or maybe just that main pole, is parallel to the edge - the crookedness looks accidental.<br/>Very much a legitimate social documentation photograph in the spirit of street photography in my <strike>arrogant</strike> humble opinion.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Ya boo etc to the nay sayers. I think I might have tried to rotate so the fence, or maybe just that main pole, is parallel to the edge - the crookedness looks accidental.Very much a legitimate social documentation photograph in the spirit of street photography in my arrogant humble opinion.', '2007-08-07 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3977403, 562906, 9821, '<td valign="top">i was one of your two 10''s ... very well done</td>', 'i was one of your two 10''s ... very well done', '2007-08-07 15:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3977751, 561763, 68769, '<td valign="top">I would have given it it''s next 10, but well you know. It was a blast, and I look foward to next time..</td>', 'I would have given it it''s next 10, but well you know. It was a blast, and I look foward to next time..', '2007-08-07 17:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
