(3977793, 563101, 73601, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation has its place but I am not usually a big fan. In this case I don''t feel it adds anything to the image. Would of liked this one better in just B&amp;W. The focus is spot on, very crisp. The car in the background is a bit distracting, especially the front windowshield. Overall a good capture.<br/> <br/>Wanted to add the B&amp;W  conversion is very good, great tones<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-07 17:36:10.</i></td>', 'Selective desaturation has its place but I am not usually a big fan. In this case I don''t feel it adds anything to the image. Would of liked this one better in just B&W. The focus is spot on, very crisp. The car in the background is a bit distracting, especially the front windowshield. Overall a good capture. Wanted to add the B&W  conversion is very good, great tones', '2007-08-07 18:19:50.000000', '2007-08-07 18:36:10.000000', 0),
(3977869, 562616, 68769, '<td valign="top">And thats the diffrence with the enough lighting, natural or otherwise. I voted this a 6, it would have been a easy 8 or more with better lighting in the front. I would lay odds .5 to 1 in overall score improvement.</td>', 'And thats the diffrence with the enough lighting, natural or otherwise. I voted this a 6, it would have been a easy 8 or more with better lighting in the front. I would lay odds .5 to 1 in overall score improvement.', '2007-08-07 18:42:59.000000', NULL, 0),
