(3978469, 563003, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very well seen and shot.  I just love how you framed the bright people against the dark background!  I suggest that you shoot for you.  If you happen to hit one most voters like, too, then great.  But make yourself happy first and foremost. :)<br/> <br/>Also, any score above 6 is good here at DPC.  And your commenters obviously loved it!  So you have strong evidence you connected with a group.  That''s my personal goal on every shot.</td>', 'Very well seen and shot.  I just love how you framed the bright people against the dark background!  I suggest that you shoot for you.  If you happen to hit one most voters like, too, then great.  But make yourself happy first and foremost. :) Also, any score above 6 is good here at DPC.  And your commenters obviously loved it!  So you have strong evidence you connected with a group.  That''s my personal goal on every shot.', '2007-08-07 22:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
