(3979605, 561671, 48471, '<td valign="top">I came to this image from your free study with a lot of coloured houses sitting on top of each other. Now, this is a good one, with colourful people sitting on top of each other. Well, I don''t know where this was taken, but at my place, people actually call this work. Who knows, maybe they''re solving quantum mechanics'' problems, or trying to figure out the aesthetics of the patterns on the street, or maybe they''re just talking business and the latest exchange rates of euro and dollar and Korean won and the Italian lira and how good was life without euro. Most probably they''re talking cars, they seem to old to talk about girls. I want one of those stripe shirts. And, great top down point of view, very nice. I tried something like this, but people didn''t like it. I''m glad they liked yours, because this point of view needs to be used more often, some interesting things can be seen from above.</td>', 'I came to this image from your free study with a lot of coloured houses sitting on top of each other. Now, this is a good one, with colourful people sitting on top of each other. Well, I don''t know where this was taken, but at my place, people actually call this work. Who knows, maybe they''re solving quantum mechanics'' problems, or trying to figure out the aesthetics of the patterns on the street, or maybe they''re just talking business and the latest exchange rates of euro and dollar and Korean won and the Italian lira and how good was life without euro. Most probably they''re talking cars, they seem to old to talk about girls. I want one of those stripe shirts. And, great top down point of view, very nice. I tried something like this, but people didn''t like it. I''m glad they liked yours, because this point of view needs to be used more often, some interesting things can be seen from above.', '2007-08-08 03:25:40.000000', NULL, 0),
