(3984353, 563123, 53278, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club,<br/> <br/>something in this picture does not work for me, i can''t really put my finger on it:<br/> <br/>technically , your BW conversion is perfect, and the focus is great.<br/>but the composition really hurt the image in my opinion, a wider angle perhaps would have given this more impact, the focus is too much on the manequin (who is lifeless).<br/>But as i am gazing at the shot, my eye gets pulled to the man walking on the right side, and i wonder what''s the story and what''s the link. i read the title i get it, but then the manequin is not looking at anything, the man is completly off the field of view. so i think it would have been better if there was a person in front of the store, and you composed  your shot to include him , that also could have had more impact.<br/> <br/>as for content , you have a great idea, and with a better execution(composition) i think this could have scored much higher.<br/> <br/>hope that comment was helpfull,<br/> <br/>cheers,<br/> <br/>Hassan<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the critique club, something in this picture does not work for me, i can''t really put my finger on it: technically , your BW conversion is perfect, and the focus is great.but the composition really hurt the image in my opinion, a wider angle perhaps would have given this more impact, the focus is too much on the manequin (who is lifeless).But as i am gazing at the shot, my eye gets pulled to the man walking on the right side, and i wonder what''s the story and what''s the link. i read the title i get it, but then the manequin is not looking at anything, the man is completly off the field of view. so i think it would have been better if there was a person in front of the store, and you composed  your shot to include him , that also could have had more impact. as for content , you have a great idea, and with a better execution(composition) i think this could have scored much higher. hope that comment was helpfull, cheers, Hassan ', '2007-08-09 15:44:15.000000', NULL, 0),
