(4005434, 562616, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww, I bet her mom loves this photo!  I sure would if this was my child.   She looks so natural and happy.   What a beautiful little girl!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awwwwww, I bet her mom loves this photo!  I sure would if this was my child.   She looks so natural and happy.   What a beautiful little girl! ', '2007-08-16 22:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4009284, 561874, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a great contrast of items in this scene. The hard frame at the top is a fine shot in itself, but you kept the human element with the street scene at the bottom too which adds scale and interest. It is like two images that work well with each other.  The B&amp;W/ toning is just crisp and nice for this too.</td>', 'This is a great contrast of items in this scene. The hard frame at the top is a fine shot in itself, but you kept the human element with the street scene at the bottom too which adds scale and interest. It is like two images that work well with each other.  The B&W/ toning is just crisp and nice for this too.', '2007-08-18 14:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
