(4014362, 563128, 44877, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, Larry. I don''t see why this didn''t score higher. The majority of your votes were sixes, so apparently people liked it. Love the different elements in the image, the color splashes and of course the poster-girl-stomp ad sequence. Very urban, very street. Keep ''em coming!</td>', 'Excellent photo, Larry. I don''t see why this didn''t score higher. The majority of your votes were sixes, so apparently people liked it. Love the different elements in the image, the color splashes and of course the poster-girl-stomp ad sequence. Very urban, very street. Keep ''em coming!', '2007-08-20 12:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
