(4026022, 563086, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture, especially with that guy in the window leveling his gaze right at you. I like how you hint at details - the half-included car, the half-included burger shop sign.  Nice tones in the processing.</td>', 'This is a great capture, especially with that guy in the window leveling his gaze right at you. I like how you hint at details - the half-included car, the half-included burger shop sign.  Nice tones in the processing.', '2007-08-24 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
