(4026183, 562518, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like this capture of gesture and expression and the usual composition makes this an interesting shot to look at.  The noise reduction smoothed things out a  bit much to my eyes though - everything looks a bit waxy.</td>', 'I like this capture of gesture and expression and the usual composition makes this an interesting shot to look at.  The noise reduction smoothed things out a  bit much to my eyes though - everything looks a bit waxy.', '2007-08-24 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026188, 562192, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how their postures are absolutely identical.  Even how they hold their arms.</td>', 'I like how their postures are absolutely identical.  Even how they hold their arms.', '2007-08-24 13:51:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026190, 562303, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desat.  Turns the concept on its head - the "unseen" one is the one most sharply in focus, while the unseeing ones dissolve into blur.</td>', 'Nice use of selective desat.  Turns the concept on its head - the "unseen" one is the one most sharply in focus, while the unseeing ones dissolve into blur.', '2007-08-24 13:52:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026195, 562357, 61651, '<td valign="top">Really glad you went with this shot - great capture of a double-take moment.</td>', 'Really glad you went with this shot - great capture of a double-take moment.', '2007-08-24 13:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026197, 562990, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, Kelli.</td>', 'Nicely composed, Kelli.', '2007-08-24 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026204, 563219, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice journalistic portrait and the perspective seems to enhance the wistfulness, somehow.  Very film-like in the processing.  Underrated, probably because it didn''t seem "street" enough to some.</td>', 'Nice journalistic portrait and the perspective seems to enhance the wistfulness, somehow.  Very film-like in the processing.  Underrated, probably because it didn''t seem "street" enough to some.', '2007-08-24 13:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026208, 563218, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of gesture, and I like how the guy in back mirrors the central subject in gesture.  It does seem to have an overall orange/yellow cast to it that detracts a bit.</td>', 'Nice capture of gesture, and I like how the guy in back mirrors the central subject in gesture.  It does seem to have an overall orange/yellow cast to it that detracts a bit.', '2007-08-24 14:00:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026216, 563018, 61651, '<td valign="top">Really great shot, captures the feel of that moment very well.  The direct look nails it, especially - makes the viewer a participant in the scene.</td>', 'Really great shot, captures the feel of that moment very well.  The direct look nails it, especially - makes the viewer a participant in the scene.', '2007-08-24 14:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026218, 562952, 61651, '<td valign="top">Loved this so much, Alan.  What a striking gaze, surrounded by all that complementary bokeh!</td>', 'Loved this so much, Alan.  What a striking gaze, surrounded by all that complementary bokeh!', '2007-08-24 14:03:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4026223, 561956, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on this shot, makes the "aliens" look as large as the bridge - it really does have a 50''s sci-fi feel to it.</td>', 'Great perspective on this shot, makes the "aliens" look as large as the bridge - it really does have a 50''s sci-fi feel to it.', '2007-08-24 14:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
