(4236524, 562897, 67152, '<td valign="top">Jon<br/>I did like this shot - and looking at the histogram of votes, so did many others.  However, as others have stated, the levels seem to be off.  I did a quick adjustment of bringing in the whites and modifying the greys and it sure did make a big difference in punch.  <br/> <br/>pm me you want to discuss<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=610924" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/67152/120/610924.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/67152/120/610924.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/67152/120/610924.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Peter</td>', 'JonI did like this shot - and looking at the histogram of votes, so did many others.  However, as others have stated, the levels seem to be off.  I did a quick adjustment of bringing in the whites and modifying the greys and it sure did make a big difference in punch.   pm me you want to discuss   Peter', '2007-11-10 05:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269099, 562652, 47483, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2007-11-26 05:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4270954, 562476, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am really pleased to have found this again - it left a big impression on me when I viewed it during the challenge, but then I ''lost'' it.  The composition is dramatically powerful, but it is the sense of aloneness (as opposed to loneliness) that is evoked that provided the lasting impression for me.  Into my favourites so that I can find it whenever I want!</td>', 'I am really pleased to have found this again - it left a big impression on me when I viewed it during the challenge, but then I ''lost'' it.  The composition is dramatically powerful, but it is the sense of aloneness (as opposed to loneliness) that is evoked that provided the lasting impression for me.  Into my favourites so that I can find it whenever I want!', '2007-11-27 08:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4286869, 561848, 22301, '<td valign="top">For the challenge, I don''t know if it worked so well. But as an image not bound by challenge constraints I think it is really cool. A case where a centered crop makes it harder to comprehend as my eye doesn''t know where to go. It has wonderful oddness I can''t quite place.</td>', 'For the challenge, I don''t know if it worked so well. But as an image not bound by challenge constraints I think it is really cool. A case where a centered crop makes it harder to comprehend as my eye doesn''t know where to go. It has wonderful oddness I can''t quite place.', '2007-12-03 20:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4313763, 563119, 44877, '<td valign="top">These are aliens sitting in a diner in a dimension that nobody else can see but you managed to capture it on camera. Brilliant!</td>', 'These are aliens sitting in a diner in a dimension that nobody else can see but you managed to capture it on camera. Brilliant!', '2007-12-13 21:12:36.000000', NULL, 0),
